@Exo.WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@TokenAdmin = COLE_AQUI_O_TOKEN_GERADO_NO_LOGIN_ADMIN
@TokenComum = COLE_AQUI_O_TOKEN_GERADO_NO_LOGIN_COMUM

###############################################################################
### 1. AUTENTICAÇÃO E AUTORIZAÇÃO (JWT - Desafio 2 SENAI)
###############################################################################

### 1.1. Login com Usuário Administrador (Com Permissão de Exclusão) -> 200 OK
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{Exo.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/usuarios/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@exoapi.com",
  "senha": "admin123"
}

###

### 1.2. Login com Usuário Comum (Autenticado, porém Sem Permissão de Exclusão) -> 200 OK
# @name loginComum
POST {{Exo.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/usuarios/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "usuario@exoapi.com",
  "senha": "user123"
}

###

### 1.3. Erro de Autenticação (401 Unauthorized) - Credenciais Inválidas no Login
POST {{Exo.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/usuarios/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@exoapi.com",
  "senha": "senha_incorreta"
}

###

### 1.4. Bloqueio de Exclusão Sem Token JWT -> 401 Unauthorized
# Tentativa de deletar projeto sem estar autenticado (sem cabeçalho Authorization)
DELETE {{Exo.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/projetos/3
Accept: application/json

###

### 1.5. Bloqueio de Exclusão Sem Permissão (Perfil Comum) -> 403 Forbidden
# Usuário autenticado, porém sem perfil Admin exigido pelo atributo [Authorize(Roles = "Admin")]
DELETE {{Exo.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/projetos/3
Authorization: Bearer {{TokenComum}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 1.6. Exclusão Autorizada com Token JWT Admin -> 200 OK
# Usuário autenticado e autorizado com perfil Admin
DELETE {{Exo.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/projetos/3
Authorization: Bearer {{TokenAdmin}}
Accept: application/json

###


###############################################################################
### 2. ENDPOINTS DE PROJETOS (CRUD)
###############################################################################

### 2.1. Listar todos os Projetos (GET) -> 200 OK
GET {{Exo.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/projetos
Accept: application/json

###

### 2.2. Buscar Projeto por ID (GET) -> 200 OK
GET {{Exo.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/projetos/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 2.3. Cadastrar novo Projeto (POST) -> 201 Created
POST {{Exo.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/projetos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nomeDoProjeto": "Sistema de Gestão de Frotas Elétricas",
  "area": "Transporte Sustentável",
  "status": true
}

###

### 2.4. Atualizar Projeto existente (PUT) -> 200 OK
PUT {{Exo.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/projetos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "nomeDoProjeto": "Portal Educacional Conectado - Versão 2.0",
  "area": "Tecnologia e Inovação",
  "status": true
}

###


###############################################################################
### 3. ENDPOINTS DE USUÁRIOS (CRUD)
###############################################################################

### 3.1. Listar todos os Usuários (GET) -> 200 OK
GET {{Exo.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/usuarios
Accept: application/json

###

### 3.2. Buscar Usuário por ID (GET) -> 200 OK
GET {{Exo.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/usuarios/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 3.3. Cadastrar novo Usuário (POST) -> 201 Created
POST {{Exo.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "novo.admin@exoapi.com",
  "senha": "123456",
  "perfil": "Admin"
}

###

### 3.4. Deletar Usuário por ID (DELETE - Requer Token Admin) -> 200 OK
DELETE {{Exo.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/usuarios/3
Authorization: Bearer {{TokenAdmin}}
Accept: application/json

###


###############################################################################
### 4. CENÁRIOS DE ERRO E EXCEÇÃO (400, 404, 409)
###############################################################################

### ERRO 1 (HTTP 400 Bad Request) - Dados Inválidos (Campos Obrigatórios Ausentes)
POST {{Exo.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/projetos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nomeDoProjeto": "",
  "area": "",
  "status": true
}

###

### ERRO 2 (HTTP 400 Bad Request) - ID Inválido na URL (Menor ou igual a zero)
GET {{Exo.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/projetos/0
Accept: application/json

###

### ERRO 3 (HTTP 400 Bad Request) - Divergência de ID entre URL e Corpo
PUT {{Exo.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/projetos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 2,
  "nomeDoProjeto": "Nome Incompatível",
  "area": "Inovação",
  "status": true
}

###

### ERRO 4 (HTTP 404 Not Found) - Exceção ProjetoNaoEncontradoException
GET {{Exo.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/projetos/9999
Accept: application/json

###

### ERRO 5 (HTTP 409 Conflict) - Exceção ProjetoDuplicadoException
POST {{Exo.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/projetos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nomeDoProjeto": "Portal Educacional Conectado",
  "area": "Educação e Tecnologia",
  "status": true
}

###
